ArchivePlayer for webOS

This software is a native client for ArchivePlayer, a self-hosted media library
for Archive.org. ArchivePlayer is a Rust rewrite derived from the original
ArchivePlayer project by Jeppe Kjeldal:

https://github.com/JeppeKjeldal/ArchivePlayer

Original work Copyright (c) 2026 Jeppe Kjeldal
Modifications Copyright (c) 2026 ArchivePlayer contributors

This client is an independent implementation of the documented ArchivePlayer
HTTP contract. It is not affiliated with or endorsed by LG Electronics or the
Internet Archive. Archive.org content remains subject to its own terms.
